r auto loan from another lender with FourLeaf, you could lower your monthly payments!\n\nLearn more\nStrengthening communities\n\nWe’re proud to make an impact through charitable giving, volunteerism, and our signature events such as the FourLeaf Air Show at Jones Beach.\n\nLearn more\n\nHow do you money?\n\nTake the exclusive MoneyType™ Quiz to discover why you are the way that you are with finances.\n\nDiscover your MoneyType\n™\nFourLeaf Digital Banking\n\nLet’s money together, from anywhere\n\nThe FourLeaf Mobile App\n\nThe convenience of FourLeaf right at your fingertips. Access your accounts 24/7, deposit checks on the go, and send money to friends and family you trust with Zelle®.\n\nLearn more\n\nDownload the FourLeaf Mobile App\n\nAvailable in the App Store and Google Play Store\n\nFinancial tools\n\nWe’re here to help!\n\nCheck out our digital banking resources, including calculators, digital banking demos, and helpful articles.\n\nCalculator\n\nHome Affordability Calculator\n\nHow much home can you afford? Use this calculator to determine the home price and monthly housing cost you can afford.\n\nView calculator\nView all calculators\n\nDigital demo\n\nMobile app at glance\n\nThis step-by-step demo shows you exactly where to click and what to do to see what’s available in the mobile banking app.\n\nPlay demo\nView all demos\n\nHelpful article\n\n6 Things to Consider in the Search for Your Dream Home\n\nSearching for your dream home? Here are 6 things to consider when you start looking.\n\nRead article\nView all articles\n\nFourLeaf Virtual Branch\n\nSchedule a video banking appointment when it’s most convenient for you\n\nSchedule today\n\nYou belong at FourLeaf\n\nAt FourLeaf, we're people-first. That's why membership is available nationwide once you open and maintain a $5 Savings Account.\n\nBecome a member\nZelle® and the Zelle® related marks are wholly owned by Early Warning Services, LLC and are used herein under license. Terms and Conditions apply. 